<!-- 21A under passage 1, Jill on the second mansion visit. Door 0 is the
     ladder up into 20C, parked off (no flags) until AOT 2 in the same
     zone asks "There's a ladder. Will you climb it?". It comes out in
     20C's pit, whose only other way out is Barry's rope (common 0x25). With
     rope=leave the rope never comes, so the ladder is held shut: the
     remembered doors make 21A, 20C and 20B look like a way back to the
     2F corridor, and a hurt bot climbed up and down it until the loop rule
     ended the run. The way out is 21B, 21C and 110 (or the 200 lift).

     Chris has no rope at all: the pit is where his own drop through
     20C's dark hole lands him (jump_into_pit, at (23100,4100)), and the
     ladder up comes out there too, at (20300,3500), walled off from the
     rest of 20C. The ladder is held shut for him on every visit: with it
     open, every trip from 21A toward the 2F corridor climbed it, found
     the door to 20B out of reach, took the ladder (20C's AOT 7) straight
     back down, and the loop rule ended the run. -->
<bot format="2">
  <avoid slot="0" bank="1" bit="0x25" while="clear" character="jill" when="rope=leave"
         reason="the ladder comes out in 20C's pit, a dead end without Barry's rope"/>
  <avoid slot="2" bank="1" bit="0x25" while="clear" character="jill" when="rope=leave"
         reason="the ladder comes out in 20C's pit, a dead end without Barry's rope"/>
  <avoid slot="0" character="chris"
         reason="the ladder comes out in 20C's pit, walled off from the rest of the room"/>
  <avoid slot="2" character="chris"
         reason="the ladder comes out in 20C's pit, walled off from the rest of the room"/>
</bot>
